		{"id":"n-comment","type":"text","text":"THE MAIN MACHINE — every session runs this. start/end are mechanical; boot is a sub-machine; idle is home. Above idle: the ad hoc group (start · continue · archive). Beside idle: the retro. Below: the planned group, symmetric. se_exit closes to end.","x":-380,"y":-1200,"width":700,"height":140}
